(5789701, 842629, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love how he''s so deep in thought and totally unaware you are taking his photo.  Great line and tones here.</td>', 'I love how he''s so deep in thought and totally unaware you are taking his photo.  Great line and tones here.', '2010-01-01 10:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5789704, 842307, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast. Well composed too.</td>', 'Great use of contrast. Well composed too.', '2010-01-01 10:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790071, 841630, 101702, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the subtle colouring. Personally I think a tighter crop on the right hand edge would help, cutting out the block in the top right hand corner and giving the subject more of the frame to look into, but definitely one of my favourites.</td>', 'Absolutely love the subtle colouring. Personally I think a tighter crop on the right hand edge would help, cutting out the block in the top right hand corner and giving the subject more of the frame to look into, but definitely one of my favourites.', '2010-01-01 15:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790168, 841711, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is superb - so much &amp; so many stories between the lines of the reaching out and the comforting hands, a lifetime of Love written there. May all of us be so connected near Journey''s End.</td>', 'This is superb - so much & so many stories between the lines of the reaching out and the comforting hands, a lifetime of Love written there. May all of us be so connected near Journey''s End.', '2010-01-01 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790171, 842484, 111808, '<td valign="top">The expression on this is just priceless. Perfect capture.</td>', 'The expression on this is just priceless. Perfect capture.', '2010-01-01 17:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790174, 842237, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a poignant moment taken at a time when busy celebration goes on all around us and very few pause to remember the ghosts of the past. The kinetic energy of the youngster on the right is in direct contrast with the quieter and much more studied and deliberate slower aura of the elder, yet there is a small overlap in the middle filled with stars, a generational sharing perhaps. The black and white choice is perfect for this as well. Superbly beautiful.</td>', 'This is a poignant moment taken at a time when busy celebration goes on all around us and very few pause to remember the ghosts of the past. The kinetic energy of the youngster on the right is in direct contrast with the quieter and much more studied and deliberate slower aura of the elder, yet there is a small overlap in the middle filled with stars, a generational sharing perhaps. The black and white choice is perfect for this as well. Superbly beautiful.', '2010-01-01 17:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790194, 842788, 111808, '<td valign="top">A tableau of winter Christmas fun just outside the window, and a silent figure inside sharing it - but not. We see an older person but from the back so we really cannot tell the expression - is it amusement? longing? the tension of waiting? This candid portrait is superb in that it gives no definitive answers except for what each watcher of the photograph interprets and brings into it. I like the view - and the backwards wreath and perfect house across the street add to this as do the muted plaid curtains which echo the person''s lighting. Such stories to be told!</td>', 'A tableau of winter Christmas fun just outside the window, and a silent figure inside sharing it - but not. We see an older person but from the back so we really cannot tell the expression - is it amusement? longing? the tension of waiting? This candid portrait is superb in that it gives no definitive answers except for what each watcher of the photograph interprets and brings into it. I like the view - and the backwards wreath and perfect house across the street add to this as do the muted plaid curtains which echo the person''s lighting. Such stories to be told!', '2010-01-01 17:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790207, 841640, 111808, '<td valign="top">Even amongst those whom most in Society would judge in a negative manner there is a quiet touch of concern for a fellow being. We don''t all get to always choose all the circumstances of our Lives but we all have similiar needs and this photograph showcases a truly human moment.</td>', 'Even amongst those whom most in Society would judge in a negative manner there is a quiet touch of concern for a fellow being. We don''t all get to always choose all the circumstances of our Lives but we all have similiar needs and this photograph showcases a truly human moment.', '2010-01-01 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790224, 842632, 111808, '<td valign="top">Contained within this simple face is the embodiment of the future - and Hope. Superb expression, masterful photograph.</td>', 'Contained within this simple face is the embodiment of the future - and Hope. Superb expression, masterful photograph.', '2010-01-01 17:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790231, 842782, 42181, '<td valign="top">Not really candid (a little too posed) but a very funny picture never the less.</td>', 'Not really candid (a little too posed) but a very funny picture never the less.', '2010-01-01 17:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790240, 842756, 42181, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, looks like her bum was hungry ;-)</td>', 'Nice moment, looks like her bum was hungry ;-)', '2010-01-01 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790242, 842500, 111808, '<td valign="top">It would be interesting to get this quartet back together again after, say, 20 years, to see how different they would be &amp; how their lives would have gone. A candid photograph of Hope and Optimism. Superb and much needed in this New Year 2010.</td>', 'It would be interesting to get this quartet back together again after, say, 20 years, to see how different they would be & how their lives would have gone. A candid photograph of Hope and Optimism. Superb and much needed in this New Year 2010.', '2010-01-01 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790340, 841601, 102505, '<td valign="top">I could not possibly disagree more with the border. But I love the shot and the moment captured. 7</td>', 'I could not possibly disagree more with the border. But I love the shot and the moment captured. 7', '2010-01-01 19:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790344, 841294, 102505, '<td valign="top">This is a well capture shot, but you could have brought out a LOT more emotion and feel in post processing (even in a BE challenge).<br/>Looking at it even more, I see enormous potential. Just needs to be coaxed out. :) I''ll still vote you a 7 for the candid humor and wonder of the kids at play.</td>', 'This is a well capture shot, but you could have brought out a LOT more emotion and feel in post processing (even in a BE challenge).Looking at it even more, I see enormous potential. Just needs to be coaxed out. :) I''ll still vote you a 7 for the candid humor and wonder of the kids at play.', '2010-01-01 19:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790345, 842237, 102505, '<td valign="top">emotive. 8</td>', 'emotive. 8', '2010-01-01 19:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790353, 842499, 102505, '<td valign="top">I like the ''frame'' of sorts created by the bokeh of the branches. Though it does distract from the subject quite a bit. And though it is ''candid'' I''m not sure I get the same sense of ''in the moment'' that I do with candid pictures of people. it''s a good shot, but it just doesn''t speak to me. 6</td>', 'I like the ''frame'' of sorts created by the bokeh of the branches. Though it does distract from the subject quite a bit. And though it is ''candid'' I''m not sure I get the same sense of ''in the moment'' that I do with candid pictures of people. it''s a good shot, but it just doesn''t speak to me. 6', '2010-01-01 19:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790356, 842636, 102505, '<td valign="top">noisy, dirty, gritty, real, day-to-day, AWESOME candid. I LOVE those parts of it. I know this kind of thing is near impossible to plan for, as is the nature of the challenge, but I can''t get settled in with the framing of this picture. My brain can''t decide if it wants to see the stairs, dude, or hallway. And it distracts from being able to ''fall into the moment''.<br/>I really enjoy your post-processing though. 7</td>', 'noisy, dirty, gritty, real, day-to-day, AWESOME candid. I LOVE those parts of it. I know this kind of thing is near impossible to plan for, as is the nature of the challenge, but I can''t get settled in with the framing of this picture. My brain can''t decide if it wants to see the stairs, dude, or hallway. And it distracts from being able to ''fall into the moment''.I really enjoy your post-processing though. 7', '2010-01-01 19:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790368, 842038, 102505, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me jealous. Long gone are the days when i could smear food on my booger covered face and relish in the ''gooooos'' and ''awwwwws'' of my adoring fans. The Tongue action seals it. Though the picture lacks ''punch''. 6. well shot.</td>', 'This picture makes me jealous. Long gone are the days when i could smear food on my booger covered face and relish in the ''gooooos'' and ''awwwwws'' of my adoring fans. The Tongue action seals it. Though the picture lacks ''punch''. 6. well shot.', '2010-01-01 19:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790398, 841383, 102505, '<td valign="top">I <b>love</b> this. Even with the totally minimalist approach to the post-processing, this picture stands out above the rest to me. <br/>I''ve never met this man and from your picture alone, I want to know him. His story, where he was going, who/what he was thinking about, where his jacket with it''s work leather and old old stains came from. The most evocative picture I''m yet to see in this challenge. 10.</td>', 'I love this. Even with the totally minimalist approach to the post-processing, this picture stands out above the rest to me. I''ve never met this man and from your picture alone, I want to know him. His story, where he was going, who/what he was thinking about, where his jacket with it''s work leather and old old stains came from. The most evocative picture I''m yet to see in this challenge. 10.', '2010-01-01 20:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790407, 841409, 102505, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, subject, and framing. I wonder how much time he spends on those sideburns....<br/>9</td>', 'Great DOF, subject, and framing. I wonder how much time he spends on those sideburns....9', '2010-01-01 20:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790412, 842772, 102505, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I can feel the energy of the fun day at the aquarium, hear the noises, and see the sighs just by looking at this picture. Though, looking at it all at once and keeping thoughts on the subject is difficult for me. I think a tighter crop down would have made this a stronger image. Cheers on the 8.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I can feel the energy of the fun day at the aquarium, hear the noises, and see the sighs just by looking at this picture. Though, looking at it all at once and keeping thoughts on the subject is difficult for me. I think a tighter crop down would have made this a stronger image. Cheers on the 8.', '2010-01-01 20:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790423, 841994, 102505, '<td valign="top">I loled. 8</td>', 'I loled. 8', '2010-01-01 20:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790441, 842813, 102505, '<td valign="top">There isn''t a single thing I don''t like about this image. Great lines, great framing, focus and DOF. I feel like I can hear the hustle. 10.</td>', 'There isn''t a single thing I don''t like about this image. Great lines, great framing, focus and DOF. I feel like I can hear the hustle. 10.', '2010-01-01 20:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790445, 842054, 102505, '<td valign="top">not a single booger......I call shenanigans!<br/>Great shot. Kind of looks like somebody else could be feeding him.<br/>9.</td>', 'not a single booger......I call shenanigans!Great shot. Kind of looks like somebody else could be feeding him.9.', '2010-01-01 20:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790448, 842311, 102505, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that the bottle is in the way and the image couldn''t have been framed more on Aunt Jane and her battle with the helicopter. A good moment and the look on her face is priceless. Keep refining. keep shooting.</td>', 'It''s too bad that the bottle is in the way and the image couldn''t have been framed more on Aunt Jane and her battle with the helicopter. A good moment and the look on her face is priceless. Keep refining. keep shooting.', '2010-01-01 20:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
