(5791432, 842738, 102505, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong here, but I feel like I can see an overgenerous use of blurring to ''soften'' the image. I don''t know, something just doesn''t look right. I think it''s a wonderful moment and a great capture, but the final product looks oddly ''cartoony'' to me. I would love to see the original. 6.</td>', 'I may be wrong here, but I feel like I can see an overgenerous use of blurring to ''soften'' the image. I don''t know, something just doesn''t look right. I think it''s a wonderful moment and a great capture, but the final product looks oddly ''cartoony'' to me. I would love to see the original. 6.', '2010-01-02 14:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791436, 842763, 102505, '<td valign="top">Well composed, creative, and meets the challenge. But it just doesn''t strike me. I wish I had something more constructive to say than that. 6</td>', 'Well composed, creative, and meets the challenge. But it just doesn''t strike me. I wish I had something more constructive to say than that. 6', '2010-01-02 14:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
