(5792927, 841640, 108544, '<td valign="top">Interesting image!  "I know your passed out, but dam, move over!" lol<br/>An unfortunate part of some people''s life''s, very well captured! Well done and a true candid!</td>', 'Interesting image!  "I know your passed out, but dam, move over!" lolAn unfortunate part of some people''s life''s, very well captured! Well done and a true candid!', '2010-01-03 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792947, 842631, 108544, '<td valign="top">You can even tell, he is eyeing up some garbage! "Is that a snicker''s wrapper?" lol<br/>Great capture of everyday life. Nice tones and comp! Oh and a true candid! Thanks you!</td>', 'You can even tell, he is eyeing up some garbage! "Is that a snicker''s wrapper?" lolGreat capture of everyday life. Nice tones and comp! Oh and a true candid! Thanks you!', '2010-01-03 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792961, 842756, 108544, '<td valign="top">Is that kid smoking? Great capture of beach life! Love the comp and lack of depth of field. <br/>Nicely done! Oh and looks like a true candid. Thank you!</td>', 'Is that kid smoking? Great capture of beach life! Love the comp and lack of depth of field. Nicely done! Oh and looks like a true candid. Thank you!', '2010-01-03 11:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792980, 842147, 108544, '<td valign="top">The focus point is unfortunately off. Not sure the camera you are using. But you may want to switch to using a single focus point. This looks like it was shot using  the automatic, focus point selector. Missing your main subject, as it took the jacket as the main subject. If you used say, just the centre focus point. The face would be sharp and the jacket out of focus. Hopefully you have this capability. Nice exposure and composition though!</td>', 'The focus point is unfortunately off. Not sure the camera you are using. But you may want to switch to using a single focus point. This looks like it was shot using  the automatic, focus point selector. Missing your main subject, as it took the jacket as the main subject. If you used say, just the centre focus point. The face would be sharp and the jacket out of focus. Hopefully you have this capability. Nice exposure and composition though!', '2010-01-03 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792987, 842759, 108544, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, comp and focus point. Great use of depth of field too. You should do quite well with this one!</td>', 'Nice tones, comp and focus point. Great use of depth of field too. You should do quite well with this one!', '2010-01-03 11:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
