(5793002, 841840, 108544, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot literally!  Great capture of everyday life! Love the tones, comp and colours! Plus the look and posture on that man is perfect! Really tells a story! Very well done and a true candid! Thank you!</td>', 'Sweet shot literally!  Great capture of everyday life! Love the tones, comp and colours! Plus the look and posture on that man is perfect! Really tells a story! Very well done and a true candid! Thank you!', '2010-01-03 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
