(5793716, 842811, 83313, '<td valign="top">Quality-wise, I think this is good, but not great. Looks like a high ISO shot in very poor light. However, you captured a wonderful display of emotion and activity on both of the subjects, and that is the point of the challenge to me.</td>', 'Quality-wise, I think this is good, but not great. Looks like a high ISO shot in very poor light. However, you captured a wonderful display of emotion and activity on both of the subjects, and that is the point of the challenge to me.', '2010-01-03 19:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793717, 842781, 83313, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not the best, but you did well at capturing something interesting when it happened.</td>', 'The lighting is not the best, but you did well at capturing something interesting when it happened.', '2010-01-03 19:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
