(5798656, 842141, 66494, '<td valign="top">Though I agree with Gatorguy that the red above is bright, I have to say from a pure art standpoint it is important that the red above stay there. If you have a particular color in a piece of art you want it to appear (ideally) three times. That you did, my friend with the top color the hat and the spots on the shoes. <br/>A piece of art this is!!!!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gatorguy:</b></div><hr/><i> One of my highest scores.  My criticism is the red bar across the top is a distraction because it''s so bright.  I would have cropped it off. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Though I agree with Gatorguy that the red above is bright, I have to say from a pure art standpoint it is important that the red above stay there. If you have a particular color in a piece of art you want it to appear (ideally) three times. That you did, my friend with the top color the hat and the spots on the shoes. A piece of art this is!!!! Originally posted by Gatorguy: One of my highest scores.  My criticism is the red bar across the top is a distraction because it''s so bright.  I would have cropped it off. ', '2010-01-06 08:40:03.000000', NULL, 0),
