(5799329, 842141, 97166, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.<br/> <br/>This is simple.<br/> <br/>It tells a story, with an element of humor.<br/> <br/>It is fairly unremarkable in WOW factor.<br/> <br/>It has almost no extraneous post-processing to speak of.<br/> <br/>It is unassuming.<br/> <br/>It is, quite frankly, the opposite of everything that DPC has come to stand for.<br/> <br/>And yet here it is with a Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/>Can it be that DPC voters actually got it RIGHT for a change?<br/> <br/>Inconceivable!</td>', 'I don''t get it. This is simple. It tells a story, with an element of humor. It is fairly unremarkable in WOW factor. It has almost no extraneous post-processing to speak of. It is unassuming. It is, quite frankly, the opposite of everything that DPC has come to stand for. And yet here it is with a Blue Ribbon. Can it be that DPC voters actually got it RIGHT for a change? Inconceivable!', '2010-01-06 16:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
